; ..\BSW364\CanIf\Implementation\CanIf.c	   680   **********************************************************************************************************************/
; ..\BSW364\CanIf\Implementation\CanIf.c	   681  /*! \brief       Checks if queued PDUs have to be transmitted.
; ..\BSW364\CanIf\Implementation\CanIf.c	   682   *  \details     Called out of CanIf_TxConfirmation(), CanIf_CancelTxConfirmation(), CanIf_CancelTxNotification().
; ..\BSW364\CanIf\Implementation\CanIf.c	   683   *  \param[in]   hth: Index of the hardware transmit handle. Parameter must be smaller than CANIF_CFG_MAX_MAILBOXES.
; ..\BSW364\CanIf\Implementation\CanIf.c	   684   *  \return      E_OK: Any Tx-PDU transmitted.
